DATA
----

data/test_records.csv and data/feature_bounds.csv are derived from:

  Clore, J., Cios, K., DeShazo, J., & Strack, B. (2014).
  Diabetes 130-US Hospitals for Years 1999-2008 [Dataset].
  UCI Machine Learning Repository.
  https://doi.org/10.24432/C5230J

Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The dataset accompanies:

  Beata Strack, Jonathan DeShazo, Chris Gennings, Juan Olmo,
  Sebastian Ventura, Krzysztof Cios, John Clore.
  "Impact of HbA1c Measurement on Hospital Readmission Rates: Analysis of
  70,000 Clinical Database Patient Records."
  BioMed Research International, vol. 2014, 2014.

The records redistributed here are a filtered, re-encoded subset of that
dataset. Changes made: encounters ending in death or hospice transfer removed;
one encounter kept per patient; 28 fields derived from the source columns; a
25% held-out split. The transformation is in scripts/build_reference.py.


